[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:A Wet Night]
[00:13.85]What happened to the boys in the night?
[00:19.69]Late in the afternoon, the boys put up their tent in the middle of a field.
[00:28.06]As soon as this was done, they cooked a meal over an open fire.
[00:35.13]They were all hungry and the food smelled good.
[00:40.12]After a wonderful meal, they told stories and sang songs by the campfire.
[00:48.15]But some time later it began to rain.
[00:52.53]The boys felt tired so they put out the fire and crept into their tent.
[00:59.84]Their sleeping bags were warm and comfortable, so they all slept soundly.
[01:06.81]In the middle of the night, two boys woke up and began shouting.
[01:12.45]The tent was full of water!
[01:15.51]They all leapt out of their sleeping bags and hurried outside.
[01:21.02]It was raining heavily and they found that a stream had formed in the field.
[01:27.78]The stream wound its way across the field and then flowed right under their tent!
